ດີແລ້ວ.

702
00:38:06,625 --> 00:38:08,333
Perhaps I was premature.
ບາງທີຂ້ອຍໄວເກີນໄປ.

703
00:38:09,416 --> 00:38:11,708
Tell us, what are our worries?
